.vercel
# NOTE: api/index.js (the bundled Vercel function) is intentionally committed.
# It is gitignored nowhere because Vercel detects Serverless Functions from the
# files present in the Git source; if it's absent from the clone, no function is
# registered and every /api/* request falls through to the static SPA (405 on
# POST). The build regenerates it on each deploy, so committed content stays
# current. See scripts/build-api.mjs and the bundle-api-function vite plugin.

